# Keep build context small and reproducible. Source for every workspace is copied
# (npm ci needs all workspace package.json files), but never host build output or
# installed deps — those are produced fresh inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.expo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
**/*.log
# Never bake local secrets/credentials into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
